flowchart LR
    Plan[Managed runtime plan] --> Eval[Application orchestration]
    Eval --> Manager[Managed package and lifecycle authority]
    Manager --> Package[Verified runtime package]
    Manager -->|Launch and retain child capability| Runtime[Managed Ollama process]
    Runtime --> Endpoint[Application-owned loopback listener]
    Eval --> Session[Single retained HTTP/1 session]
    Session -->|One owned client socket| Endpoint
    Session -->|Connection and process checks| Manager
    Session --> Preflight[Ordered read-only Ollama requests]
    Eval --> Report[Managed evidence, still unqualified until full closure]

    classDef trust fill:#eef,stroke:#446;
    classDef changed fill:#efe,stroke:#484,stroke-width:2px;
    classDef boundary fill:#fee,stroke:#844;
    class Manager,Package trust;
    class Session,Runtime changed;
    class Endpoint boundary;
